{% set lounge = site.agenda.vibeLounge %}

<img class="vibe-page-banner" src="/assets/images/vibe-lounge-banner.png" alt="DevFest 2026 Vibe Lounge" width="1600" height="893">

<p>
    The Vibe Lounge is a relaxed room where you build with Gemini. You pick a challenge, build it in about 40 minutes with
    Google AI Studio, and leave with a live app. No coding experience needed: every challenge starts simple and gets harder
    for those who want more.
</p>

<p class="vibe-page-host">
    Led by <a href="{{ lounge.host.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ lounge.host.name }}</a>, {{ lounge.host.role }},
    with community mentors in the room.
</p>

<h2 id="sprints">Sprints</h2>
<p>Each sprint is one batch: everyone starts together and finishes together. No lounge over lunch (11:45 to 13:00).</p>

<div class="agenda-vibe-grid">
    {% for sprint in site.agenda.vibeLoungeSlots %}
    <div class="agenda-vibe-card">
        <div class="agenda-vibe-header">
            <span class="venue-badge">{{ sprint.slot }}</span>
            <span class="agenda-vibe-time">{{ sprint.time }}</span>
        </div>
        <h3>{{ sprint.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ sprint.focus }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2 id="challenges">Challenges</h2>
<p>Pick one, or bring your own idea. Each one fits in a single sprint.</p>

<div class="vibe-challenge-grid">
    {% for challenge in lounge.challenges %}
    <div class="vibe-challenge-card">
        <span class="vibe-pill">{{ challenge.tag }}</span>
        <h3>{{ challenge.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ challenge.summary }}</p>
        {% if challenge.note %}
        <p class="vibe-challenge-note"><strong>Heads-up:</strong> {{ challenge.note }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a class="vibe-challenge-link" href="{{ challenge.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ challenge.linkLabel }}</a>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>

{% if lounge.repoUrl %}
<p>All challenges and the sprint flow in one place: <a href="{{ lounge.repoUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ lounge.repoUrl | replace("https://", "") }}</a></p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="bring">What to bring</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>A personal laptop.</strong> A phone works, but a laptop makes it much easier to switch between the app preview, the code and your prompts. Work laptops often block what AI Studio needs.</li>
    <li><strong>A personal Google account</strong> (an @gmail.com address). Work and university accounts can block features or deployment.</li>
    <li><strong>Your charger.</strong></li>
</ul>

<h2 id="flow">How a sprint works</h2>
<ol>
    <li><strong>Come in at the start of a sprint.</strong> Check in at the door; a volunteer keeps each batch together.</li>
    <li><strong>Open your challenge</strong> from this page and sign in at <a href="https://ai.studio/build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ai.studio/build</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Build.</strong> Start from the challenge prompt, then add features one prompt at a time. Mentors in the room help when you get stuck.</li>
    <li><strong>Publish.</strong> Deploy to Cloud Run from AI Studio, or use Share for a quick public link. With a personal account and no Google Cloud billing history, the free Starter Tier covers up to two apps with no credit card.</li>
    <li><strong>Show it and claim your badge.</strong> At the end of the sprint a few people demo their live apps, and everyone gets the official DevFest 2026 Vibe Lounge badge in the room.</li>
</ol>

<p>
    Share what you built with <strong>#DevFest</strong>. See the full day on the <a href="/agenda/">agenda</a>.
</p>
